msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫She was absolutely right."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫Elle a entièrement raison."

#: badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a94e8c46785a6247cd58ea64b352ab3514b4ad0a52da6d5c703f8ce6298908b1
#. default-sha256: b46c99c2ae40b7a9eb3d4fe1d496171de20db46a5180a3d83c6dac688d7072e4
msgctxt "badend:badend_DBD2CF6C_607D_4CF7_8EC2_94F7546120B4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ had seen an excess of tragedy."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous avez⟪k:2⟫La Défunte a⟪k:3⟫ vu beaucoup trop de tragédies."

#: badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a7f027be8bc29cbe0aceed5d53c36bd5c8727f1ce9dab6cacec5827b12c0c36
#. default-sha256: 81d055f819bf06d44d8a0c81efca8f94281b25aac6f0230e2c77fcef844b7b43
msgctxt "badend:badend_E791CD14_B216_439A_81DB_5B62B7ADC592"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ had borne witness to far too much pain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous avez⟪k:2⟫Elle a⟪k:3⟫ été témoin de beaucoup trop de souffrances."

#: badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5b78cb805cc9b122e4c01cb241f46ff265e5ffcbaec9c8ecb08be1c58531a760
#. default-sha256: c17a32a04ebb70da1ea2ff98f8543dae9506a982d75f47e2b93e622c879a2bf6
msgctxt "badend:badend_AF0307E1_ED6B_4762_B4A3_C0E138043E7B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And ⟪k:1⟫Your⟪k:2⟫his⟪k:3⟫ spirit was deeply wounded by it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Et ⟪k:1⟫votre⟪k:2⟫son⟪k:3⟫ esprit en est profondément blessé."

#: badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 845758665f60595aebf81a0426842a9e53928e0017abadf9dbe80a204a8bd397
#. default-sha256: 5a4d4001916fbe1efac2ff826dc260d0f49e2efc9422228558002dfcd243ba11
msgctxt "badend:badend_66FBD3A0_5A11_44C7_BEFD_B7C18680597A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫He⟪k:3⟫ could not possibly endure any further tragedy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous ne pouvez décemment pas⟪k:2⟫Elle ne peut décemment pas⟪k:3⟫ endurer de nouvelles "
"tragédies."

#: badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d64686f868d55e1d131a4070e00c404d14831bd281c2236475cc565c2662f713
#. default-sha256: 8beb6b5e8f2f246dae28970beb43584f26a4daaa4700f055a6ece72ff93f9e19
msgctxt "badend:badend_36EFD0B6_09EA_4A1A_85F7_30C6F145ACA6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And so, if she was offering ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ relief from all that, perhaps ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫"
"he⟪k:6⟫ should accept it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et donc, si elle ⟪k:1⟫vous⟪k:2⟫lui⟪k:3⟫ offre d’être libérée de tout cela, peut-être ⟪k:4⟫"
"que vous devriez⟪k:5⟫qu’elle devrait⟪k:6⟫ accepter."

#: badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34f9ea7344d17692cae4bc15d9c87784d277e012b4af35f13207b8f00b2c166b
#. default-sha256: 68045209c57d8826f92cd186c7a5644a79dc48e1866418114cf7330e63fea580
msgctxt "badend:badend_7C79C15B_9D28_40F4_962C_560B595A0855"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She had guided ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ this far, never letting go of ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ "
"hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Elle ⟪k:1⟫vous a⟪k:2⟫l’a⟪k:3⟫ guidée jusque-là, sans jamais ⟪k:4⟫vous⟪k:5⟫lui⟪k:6⟫ lâcher la "
"main."

#: badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43c7d13d4589790ff2e127c94cce67afb6d14961cb4806ac282683e42264e432
#. default-sha256: 9f28c950f647c7dcee80c8435fc8623c79380d65e0bc4185cd2dcbf79a6d9ba1
msgctxt "badend:badend_3F2365CC_9CD3_4348_96E8_29A51C38F382"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And it was her presence that had allowed ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫ to bear the bleak, "
"disheartening, and wretched tales ⟪k:4⟫You⟪k:5⟫he⟪k:6⟫ saw."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et c’est sa présence qui ⟪k:1⟫vous⟪k:2⟫lui⟪k:3⟫ a permis de supporter les contes lugubres, "
"démoralisants, tristes à mourir ⟪k:4⟫que vous avez⟪k:5⟫qu’elle a⟪k:6⟫ vus."

#: badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1e4d661c32017711f2e0196e86be553619e46da8fcdd24098b7c9319b98c561
#. default-sha256: a6176a5a71ca2e727417afe91b266e052a791f94a91fb8f9b9bb6ba978a0310b
msgctxt "badend:badend_77AE4EFD_0BEB_42E1_A52B_C9808F0E84A9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫the Departed⟪k:3⟫ really need anything other than her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Aviez-vous⟪k:2⟫La Défunte a-t-elle⟪k:3⟫ vraiment besoin d’autre chose ? Sa présence ne "
"suffit-elle pas ?"

#: badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe008bb1f8f1ac130f3d240cf0433c50bbc2b54c268fe8c0a6ee32494d1982e2
#. default-sha256: 120f55eb80766b79957733f4faa4bb62de30bcfe4a00276d62fb52678c87be65
msgctxt "badend:badend_264B638E_F9ED_4D3A_86F9_5DD7FC3FEA53"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If she said she wanted to be with ⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫him⟪k:3⟫,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Si elle dit qu’elle veut être avec ⟪k:1⟫vous⟪k:2⟫elle⟪k:3⟫,"

#: badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c58550daf473771378ec87b8386a6217c8bfe9a4bd80f8cc5589ad0c07d6d598
#. default-sha256: f65456768226024539b6d50d08aca24135fe71793212c743d448d5f1b06c8ff0
msgctxt "badend:badend_0C20D1B3_0A24_4DBB_B857_152286353C56"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then surely ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ allowed to want the same."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫alors certainement ⟪k:1⟫vous avez⟪k:2⟫elle a⟪k:3⟫ le droit de vouloir la même chose."

#: badend:badend_DA85CFA1_92FA_46A7_9F1A_A7666E361742
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ee90cc7001ef6c3269d8d1f2f82dfdd5cd2ec75166fb567c1d392e85c44326c
