msgctxt "badend:badend_3915BB6B_3C00_441F_BA02_CACC127487F6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ gently wrapped ⟪k:4⟫Your⟪k:5⟫his⟪k:6⟫ fingers around the "
"Maid’s cold hand."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous entourez doucement de vos doigts⟪k:2⟫La Défunte entoure doucement de ses "
"doigts⟪k:3⟫ la main froide de la Servante."

#: badend:badend_C2FB14B1_07D8_4207_929D_EC8C5B7A68BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 551a949eeb9cb94c3186767ebbedbb0e7141799c5fe4364cfda842eaf55682cb
