msgctxt "badend:badend_EAA90AAE_67A8_4496_8BA6_AE73C80B00D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫the rare, treasured days of happiness,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫les jours de bonheur rares, chéris,"

#: badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 37fb76108eb3e959e3a93deac257e56939cfbf9851e93fc0677481114e6bb4fe
#. default-sha256: 20c7f580572d56187a2c39f011e74fe3813a40aefdbf8cb61fb3fd6c70f411b2
msgctxt "badend:badend_56C479A0_7DFD_4EE0_9FFF_322BDA18E0A2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the bitter days filled with nothing but pain,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ou les jours amers, remplis uniquement de souffrance,"

#: badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ce74a7e31dbf401b897ed8e592966e5bfefd7a54864cb1bf470ea366977075d9
#. default-sha256: 038c9c5dadbe200b45b3b0337b777486bc77a40ac18a6ae5182b0d73cac58564
msgctxt "badend:badend_0DC26A41_A3FA_4FCC_954D_84814ECB3595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or the person ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ supposed to find."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫ou la personne ⟪k:1⟫que vous êtes⟪k:2⟫qu’elle est⟪k:3⟫ censée retrouver."

#: badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06aa029ccef0343851337d6a27c783e77e0ca6221dbeaf559385fe3147532baa
#. default-sha256: c1ac44eecfeb39c7c6461a210e3ff6e4d3e5cb31997eec6830f2c6d3e4d85db1
msgctxt "badend:badend_9597D371_8F16_48D8_B133_E897C5ABDA2F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But ⟪k:1⟫You were⟪k:2⟫he was⟪k:3⟫ fine with that. ⟪k:4⟫There was no one to criticize ⟪k:5⟫"
"You⟪k:6⟫him⟪k:7⟫ for averting ⟪k:8⟫Your⟪k:9⟫his⟪k:10⟫ eyes from ⟪k:11⟫Your⟪k:12⟫his⟪k:13⟫ pain "
"and seizing the opportunity for happiness lying before ⟪k:14⟫You⟪k:15⟫him⟪k:16⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais cela ⟪k:1⟫vous⟪k:2⟫lui⟪k:3⟫ va. ⟪k:4⟫Il n’y a personne pour ⟪k:5⟫vous⟪k:6⟫lui⟪k:7⟫ "
"reprocher de détourner les yeux de la souffrance et de saisir l’occasion qui se présente d’être "
"heureuse."

#: badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7826af7eb8822a945a0604a413ab2d07cd70d4b34cdf573ebc3151ebfd6618fd
#. default-sha256: a5b99b75e6a69277b803facffc6cdd33c2af69f86c5816545ced9dd329bd6d09
msgctxt "badend:badend_3EDA9B4B_D931_44BE_B22D_1D681440EFE9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You⟪k:2⟫The Departed⟪k:3⟫ made the correct choice."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Vous avez⟪k:2⟫La Défunte a⟪k:3⟫ fait le bon choix."

#: badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a264de2d2f8af1e4b63ae79090b16b666e54f40cc3702d255bffc76f5dc14e4b
#. default-sha256: ac87a40faa65b5602892f8ba68d743bf513c67d8297de1612082997558ecca3f
msgctxt "badend:badend_A8975700_5290_4EF8_8591_7B9B4986DDFA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Master... ⟪k:14⟫Master."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫Maître... ⟪k:14⟫Maître."

#: badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b77e6424588ff87abe7fb2bd0dc875500f5ccd3d65805dd63af39aa1d96dfe26
#. default-sha256: fe5818ca2156e111c599604f11c5c5655ff87f027c0cd9365b23a008a7a6180f
msgctxt "badend:badend_29D46658_3C72_4F60_8EBD_02064AC70CDB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, thank goodness. You have awoken.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I was getting worried there for a moment."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, Dieu merci. Vous vous êtes réveillée.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫C’est que je commençais à "
"m’inquiéter."

#: badend:badend_9DC2F38C_144D_445D_AC6E_F7CB12141173
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 71ee705aa34b7aa900728b51f6522592a37cc6762b9a65b020aa11be5a071472
#. default-sha256: cd7498fb363de3d6f8e3ed064798dee2013fc89566525d07119f4ce25b21039f
msgctxt "badend:badend_9DC2F38C_144D_445D_AC6E_F7CB12141173"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫What kind of herbal tea would you like to start your day with?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I have "
